(text "POWER rev 0.2. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nVIN_12 splits into two protected branches. +12V_MCU feeds only the bucks. +12V_COIL feeds only the switch, ignition and coils.\\nThe MCU branch stays up when the relay switch is open. Coil current does not flow through Q_MCU or the bucks.\\nAP2112K is removed. 3.3 V is an AP63203 buck straight from +12V_MCU, so the Wi-Fi current is not dropped across a 1.7 V linear regulator." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e2cd5fd0-7124-42f0-940f-32067131e632"))
